                <pb facs="0806" n="712" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg712"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Olney to Mr.
                            Taylor.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-05-01"><hi rendition="#italic">May 1,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Urge Spanish foreign office to at once instruct Captain-General Cuba to strictly
                    observe protocol applicable to trial of American citizens found on board <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Competitor</hi>. This cable sent at instance of
                    Consul-General Williams. Cable result.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
